      "text": "Traffic Advisory:  McPhillips Street is currently closed in both directions between Logan Avenue and Jarvis Avenue due to an ongoing police incident. Officers are on scene, and the roadway will re-open once it is safe to do so. \n\nMotorists are encouraged to avoid the area and use alternate routes such as Salter Street or Keewatin Street.\n\nWe appreciate the public’s patience and cooperation.\n\n#WpgTMC #Winnipeg #Wpgtraffic",
